{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For if Kain is to be consumed.</b> That is, when Kain will be consumed — when they go into exile." "<b>How long? Asshur — that is,</b> until when will this thing be — [that it not be] for a long time, and you will not be in captivity, for Asshur will take you captive, and you will not be consumed and destroyed from the world like Amalek. Therefore, one who quarrels with them is a fool, and one who makes peace with them is wise."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {1 "The bracketed שלא יהי' is retained from the source; the sense of the passage is uncertain and the translation is hyper-literal."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:08.748367375Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}